# Loaded by `next dev` only. Not by Vitest, not by a production build.
#
# Off: `npm run dev` starts with the tenant's catalogue and no decision history,
# which is the state every new tenant starts in. Decided by the product owner on
# 2026-09-17. Every screen that reads the ledger says what will appear once a
# decision exists, and `tests/e2e-empty` holds them to it.
#
# For the generated history — 10,400 decisions, their deliveries and outcomes,
# executed into the in-memory ledger at start (ADR-018 §3) — run
# `npm run dev:seeded`. A variable set in the environment beats this file.
#
# `0` means off. Until 2026-09-17 it meant "seed everything", because the store
# read the string `"0"` as truthy; `seedPlanFromEnv` in `mocks/store.ts` decides now.
METIS_SEED_LEDGER=0
